{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1525798-experience-for-a-future-story","id":1525798,"title":"Experience for a future story","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-11-22T10:28:02-08:00","id":1525798,"title":"Experience for a future story","content":"It's something i wanna try, replacing the xp system by a training time. For exemple to get a new dot in an attribute the pc must train 30 days and half of that time for skills. For the case of vampire i would think 30 days for your clan discipline and 60 for others.<br /> <br /> It could even be a proggressive training time depending on the level, the 2nd dot would take less training time than the 5th.<br /> <br /> Any suggestion about the needed duration?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26839-cain-loup-noir","name":"Cain Loup-Noir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26839_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-23T09:45:42-08:00","id":1525847,"title":"","content":"There's a Gurps book...<br /> <br /> But seriously, there is.<br /> <br /> Now, if you want to devise your own system, you might wanna take one thing into consideration:<br /> <br /> How powerful should a 1.000 years old elder be?<br /> <br /> Make the sheet for one. Go crazy.<br /> <br /> Then you divide the amount of XP the elder has by 1000, in order to get the amount of XP per year.<br /> <br /> Pretty simple right?<br /> <br /> Now, let's complicate things a bit:<br /> <br /> - How paranoid was this elder about the need to increase his own mojo? Was he constantly on the grinding, hitting the local magical library in training his new &quot;spells&quot; 24/7 like a power hungry crazy, or was he constantly frolicking in the woods, enjoying life as a supernatural super being and all the benefits that come from his supernatural mojo?<br /> <br /> - Was he active during all that time, or did he spent some of that time being tortured in Hell before being resurrected by witches, or spent some 200 years in cryogenic sleep under the care of some crazy technomamcers or some such?<br /> <br /> So, my suggestion would be for you to take an &quot;AVERAGE&quot; 1000 years dude.<br /> <br /> Then, let's say you want that beast to have 10.000 XP, for example.<br /> <br /> So, that gives an amount of 10 XP points per year ON AVERAGE.<br /> <br /> This means that, if q guy does nothing but recite his spells as if an Olympic Athlete, then this amount could be... Maybe up to 4x as fast (maybe more if the guy is under intense training under a highly competent teacher, like 6x as much).<br /> <br /> If the guy just spends most of his time throwing parties and socializing and building webs of political intrigues, maybe that could be half (or lower).<br /> <br /> Or perhaps, you could say that the elder constantly throwing parties instead of practicing in his magical lab, maybe that elder is also advancing at the same rate, except that his advancing his Backgrounds and his social skills, instead of advancing his supernatural mojo that much.<br /> <br /> So, instead of trying to figure out some random times, just change a fixed amount of time per 1 XP. I usually use 1 month per 1 XP, that to me is a good average, which gives 12 XP per year.<br /> <br /> I also use that formula when I need to skip time in the narrative - &quot;so, the next 12 years passed with things being more or less the same. Add 144 XP to your sheets, and now our history meets at...&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":28035,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28035-magus-maximus","user":"Magus Maximus","date":". 11-23-2023, 12:49 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28035-magus-maximus","name":"Magus Maximus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-23T09:54:05-08:00","id":1525848,"title":"","content":"It's worth noting that, &quot;intense training&quot; means doing nothing else... So, although that could achieve faster results, his Backgrounds would suffer. I highly doubt any elder could ever spend 1000 studying and practicing in a chantry while his enemies conspire unopposed around him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28035-magus-maximus","name":"Magus Maximus","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"569"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-11-23T10:27:03-08:00","id":1525850,"title":"","content":"There's a table in V20 that give you bonus xp depending on the age of your vampire, 1000xp for methusela. Knowing a methusela is around 1000 years old it give 1xp per years.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28035-magus-maximus\" style=\"background-image:url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"28035\" data-vbnamecard=\"28035\">Magus Maximus</a> the idea is to focus on something a bit more accurate to what we do to get better than xp. How much time would you need to pass at the gym to get stronger, time that would give 1 new dot in a physical attribute. How much time on a climbing wall or running, swimming... do you need to get better in athletic and get in game a new dot.<br /> <br /> Then we define an average amount of time for attributes and skills and fix that amount as must practice time for the pc to get a new dot somewhere","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26839-cain-loup-noir","name":"Cain Loup-Noir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26839_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"390"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}